# `STATECHART-GENRE-SCOPE`: `statechart` is surface that `figdown 0.1` does not have, so a 0.1
# document naming it is a line error — and NOT the `unknown genre` error, which
# would send the author hunting a typo that is not there. core §13.7 forbids
# reinterpreting a document under a version other than the one it declares, so
# the engine may not quietly promote this file to 0.2; it says which version
# the genre needs and stops. Second header: the same genre at 0.2 is fine.
figdown 0.1 statechart
state a "A"
figdown 0.2 statechart
state b "B"
